        },
        {
          "text": " Kobala ŋes ebe, “Aso koany, ejai toma ore lo etuŋanan loka Edeke, erai da etuŋanan Iocyonitai, edolenenete kere nuelimuni: asa kaloto nina; diat kilimokini nuka alositewok.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
