        },
        {
          "text": " (Lem sek kol sirael, naelosio ituŋanan aiŋitun Edeke, kobala kwanata ebe, “Bia, kaloto mama ejai ekadwaran”; naarai ŋol loenyaritai. Kwana Enabi anyaritai lem sek Ekadwaran.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
