            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Moi, osawa lopclo kejukakini jo etuŋanan loka akwap naka Benyamin, inyonyoikini ŋes akinyet araun ekapolon loeyait ikatuŋa Isirael, itajari ŋesi ikatuŋa kakan naka Ipilisitian: naarai ete ikatuŋa, naarai adolu aimonyokec mama ajai.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
